── SYNTAX ERROR ─────────────────── E0100_list_type_in_brackets.lt:1:14  [E0100]

Stilt writes a list type as `List<T>`:

  1 │ fn total(xs: [i64]) -> i64 {
    │              ^

Brackets build a list value, as `[1, 2]`; a type names its kind, as `List<i64>`.

To fix it, write the type:

  1 │ fn total(xs: List<i64>) -> i64 {
    │              ~~~~~~~~~
